DESCRIPTION:Speaker: Tristan Gagnon-Bartsch\, University of Iowa\nHosted 
 by: Jason Somerville\n\nI am an Assistant Professor in the Economics Dep
 artment at the University of Iowa\, Tippie College of Business. I am a b
 ehavioral economist working with a mix of economic theory and experiment
 s. Much of my research studies errors in belief formation\, how these er
 rors distort markets\, and how they might be corrected.\n\nhttps://econ.
